  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "There is a checkered field with 10510^5105 rows (numbered 111 through 10510^5105) and 10510^5105 columns (numbered 111 through 10510^5105). NNN different cells in this field (numbered 111 through NNN) are marked; for each valid iii, the coordinates of the iii-th marked cell are (xi,yi)(x_i, y_i)(xi​,yi​).\n\nA set of cells is suitable if it meets the following conditions:\n\n\nAll marked cells belong to this set.\nFor any two cells aaa and bbb belonging to this set, there is a path between them with length ∣xa−xb∣+∣ya−yb∣|x_a - x_b| + |y_a - y_b|∣xa​−xb​∣+∣ya​−yb​∣ which only visits cells in this set. Each pair of consecutive cells in a path must have a common side.\nYou need to find the smallest possible size of a suitable set of cells, as well as the number of sets with this smallest size. Since the number of sets may be very large, compute it modulo 109+710^9 + 7109+7.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "0≤T≤10 \\leq T \\leq 10≤T≤1",
      "1≤xi,yi≤1051 \\leq x_i, y_i \\leq 10^51≤xi​,yi​≤105 for each valid iii",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (10 points):**",
      "T=1T = 1T=1",
      "xi≤5x_i \\leq 5xi​≤5 for each valid iii",
      "yi≤4y_i \\leq 4yi​≤4 for each valid iii",
      "**Subtask #2 (30 points):** T=0T = 0T=0",
      "Example Input`6 1",
      "3 3",
      "4 3",
      "1 1",
      "5 4",
      "5 2",
      "2 2",
      "`Example Output`10 2",
      "`ExplanationThe two suitable sets with the smallest size 101010 are"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains two space-separated integers NNN and TTT.\nNNN lines follow. For each valid iii, the iii-th of these lines contains two space-separated integers xix_ixi​ and yiy_iyi​.",
    "outputFormat": "If T=0T = 0T=0, print a single line containing one integer ― the smallest size of a suitable set.\nIf T=1T = 1T=1, print a single line containing two space-separated integers ― the smallest size of a suitable set and the number of sets with this size modulo 109+710^9+7109+7.",
